{
  "id": "05966_kouso",
  "headword": "{控訴|こうそ}",
  "reading": "こうそ",
  "part_of_speech": "noun, suru verb",
  "gloss": "appeal (to a higher court)",
  "conjugation": {
    "type": "suru",
    "prefix": "{控訴|こうそ}"
  },
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "appeal (to a higher court)",
      "explanation": "The act of requesting a higher court to review and overturn a lower court's decision. In Japan, specifically refers to appealing from district court to high court."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "05966_kouso_ex1",
      "japanese": "{判決|はんけつ}を{不服|ふふく}として{控訴|こうそ}した。",
      "english": "Dissatisfied with the verdict, they filed an appeal.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "05966_kouso_ex2",
      "japanese": "{控訴審|こうそしん}で{判決|はんけつ}が{覆|くつがえ}った。",
      "english": "The verdict was overturned in the appeals court.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "05966_kouso_ex3",
      "japanese": "{控訴|こうそ}{期限|きげん}は{判決|はんけつ}から{二週間|にしゅうかん}だ。",
      "english": "The deadline to appeal is two weeks from the verdict.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "JAPANESE COURT SYSTEM:\n{控訴|こうそ} specifically refers to appealing from:\n- {地方裁判所|ちほうさいばんしょ} (District Court) → {高等裁判所|こうとうさいばんしょ} (High Court)\n\nRELATED TERMS:\n- {控訴審|こうそしん}: appeals trial\n- {控訴人|こうそにん}: appellant\n- {被控訴人|ひこうそにん}: appellee\n- {控訴棄却|こうそききゃく}: dismissal of appeal\n\nDIFFERENCE FROM {上訴|じょうそ}:\n- {控訴|こうそ}: Appeal to high court (second instance)\n- {上告|じょうこく}: Appeal to Supreme Court (third instance)\n- {上訴|じょうそ}: General term for any appeal",
